{"3933210": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Space Hood", "steam_appid": 3933210, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defend your base. Raid the enemy. Conquer the stars.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tower defense game with a raiding twist: build or upgrade powerful fortifications, balance your economy, launch daring raids, and explore space for lost relics and advanced technologies. Every run offers new strategies and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933210/extras/4448536ca91901cbc82d1f5a3cb0db8d.avif?t=1771339583\" width=1560 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The galaxy is in turmoil. Hostile forces of Nova Roma corp. close in on your stronghold, wave after wave, determined to see your defenses crumble. But you are not just a defender — you are a raider, a builder, and an explorer of the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this blend of <strong>tower defense, strategy, and roguelike</strong>, every decision shapes your survival. Will you invest in your economy, strengthen your defenses, or strike boldly at your enemies before they overwhelm you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend and Raid</strong><br>Hold the line against relentless attackers while seizing opportunities to raid enemy positions and harvest their resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the Stars</strong> <br>Dispatch expeditions into the unknown to uncover rare relics and alien technologies that can turn the tide of battle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933210/extras/1c13d79ec8756ead185bdcaaeab55af9.avif?t=1771339583\" width=1560 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Mastery</strong><br>Balance your spending between economy, attack, and defense. The path you choose will determine whether your base thrives or falls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades and New Technologies</strong><br>Unlock advanced towers, shields, drones, and powerful upgrades to outlast ever-stronger waves.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving Challenges</strong><br>No two runs are alike. Each playthrough brings new threats, new relics, and new ways to build your strategy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933210/extras/509c2f63e1c20d451806bd3117bc97c2.avif?t=1771339583\" width=1560 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The future of your planet lies in your hands. <strong>Will you be the fortress that stands eternal — or will you be just another corporate slave? </strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defend your base. Raid the enemy. Conquer the stars.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tower defense game with a raiding twist: build or upgrade powerful fortifications, balance your economy, launch daring raids, and explore space for lost relics and advanced technologies. Every run offers new strategies and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933210/extras/4448536ca91901cbc82d1f5a3cb0db8d.avif?t=1771339583\" width=1560 height=180 /></span>